    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55017" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρράπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stitch on</i> or <i>over</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρη κατερραμμένη ῥιπὶ καλάμων</span> a frame
				<i>lashed to</i> a crate, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.96
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stitch tight</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἔς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			; <i>sew up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.5.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθον εἰς τὴν ζώνην κ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				81
			</span></i>; in Surgery, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.783
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				31.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρρᾰφῆναι ἐν μηρῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agatharch.
					7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς δέρμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.68
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>devise, compass</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πενθεῖ καταρράψας μόρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
